      "rationale": "Defines the fresh simplifyBody symbol as the exact function-body statement sequence.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-dc4da1bba542df01424716eaa5cec1e8cb47a224139dcf3b50161a3a61a0fc2f",
      "start_line": 88,
      "text": "  rule simplifyBody =>\n    Assign(Name(\"part\"), Int(0))\n    Assign(Name(\"a\"), Int(0))\n    Assign(Name(\"b\"), Int(0))\n    Assign(Name(\"c\"), Int(0))\n    Assign(Name(\"d\"), Int(0))\n    Assign(Name(\"ch\"), Str(\"\"))\n    For(\n      Name(\"ch\"),\n      BinOp(\"+\", BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"x\"), Str(\"/\")), Name(\"n\")),\n      simplifyLoopBody)\n    simplifyReturn\n    .Stmts"
    },
